					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display: none"></div> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">On the Subject Of the Kara</span></p> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/QgeEszY.png" style="width:300px;" alt="QgeEszY.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">A drawing of the Kara</span> I hate drawing myself. It's annoying and it takes 70 years.</p> </div> </div> <p>What do Karas do? We’re very unsure.</p> <p>We know that se enjoys art, music, and occasionally fire. Possibly avian in nature? Though, se has shown signs of being a cat, and a bird, also strangely a monkey? Its assumed se is a harpy. Probably a shapeshifter as well. <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Contain at all costs.</span> To never be contained.</p> <p>Se had an odd quote he keeps carving into everything. We understand nothing about this weird creature.</p> <p><em>”You are a lie.”</em></p> <p>Se has ruined 40 desks.</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">The Personnel File</span></p> <hr /> <p>Hello Hello!</p> <p>I’m Kara!</p> <p>No, no. Sit down, and shut up. Leaving is illegal, and there will be <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">appropriate</span> lethal force taken to ensure you stay in this room.</p> <p>So, about me…</p> <p>I somehow managed to get an author page, so uh, yay!!! I have a <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/karas-art-page-of-doom">cool art page</a> I guess? Gonna try and break it soon! I write mostly tales here on this wiki. So, I guess if you want those you could scroll down. Maybe?</p> <p>In the meantime, I like <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/bird">Team Bird</a> WAY too much and I’ve read everything over like 5 almost 6 times now. Same with Parks and Recreation, but I’ve watched that show about 50 times over and have almost all of the script memorized. Did you know that I also hold a 2nd place speed run time for SCP-022?</p> <p>Aside from my bragging, we should get into things ACTUALLY about me. I’m 16, se/sim/serself, in marching band, jazz band, and concert band. I play bassoon, piano, and synth. We here in Texas love our football, but I just enjoy marching band. I have made region band 3 times, and honestly if you get me talking about band I may never shut up!</p> <p>As you could probably tell I really like doing art. Did I mention my art page yet?!?</p> <p>“Yeah, like 2 times now.”</p> <p>Well, fuck you too then!</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">My Works that have been Posted</span></p> <hr /> <div id="wiki-tabview-826c736836f419eb9238e6afd3336625" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Tales</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>SCPs</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Hubs/GoI Formats</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Art Pages</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Fan art</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>SSRTOD</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="top-border"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>Tales</span></h1> <hr /></div> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">CANREN CON</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">Katalina and Cal Tales</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">SCP-5097 Tales</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">Team Bird Tales</span></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">Fan art of things I wrote!</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;SCP-5963</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Yoink</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:800px;"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/sDJuUdK.png" style="width:800px;" alt="sDJuUdK.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:800px;"> <p>Made by the wonderful <span class="error-inline"><em>Epsilon Scott</em> does not match any existing user name</span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <div style="text-align: center;"></div> <p><span style="font-size:50%;">(Bonus points if you guess what SSRTOD means.)</span></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">Social Media</span></p> <hr /> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/0YCeiKe.png" style="width:300px;" alt="0YCeiKe.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Its my friend and I right after Prelims BOA San Antonio 2019! (I’m on the right)</p> </div> </div> <p>Honestly, that's it. I have nothing else to my name, EXCEPT FOR THESE COOL SOCIAL LINK-A-MEDIAS!<br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="font-size:200%;"><a href="https://www.deviantart.com/karalinekatt">My DeviantArt</a><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <a href="https://twitter.com/katt_kara">My Twitter</a><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/Karakatt1325/">My Instagram</a><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9kKXVXQNbJgnvKDELhLqIw?view_as=subscriber">My Youtube</a><br /></span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-size:150%;">The Three People I Stan Too Hard</span></p> <hr /> <p>“That's it?”</p> <p>Don’t like it? Wait a month or five, there might be more! Or not, I don’t know…</p> <p>In the time between, go read some of these wonderful peoples’ work!</p> <div id="wiki-tabview-134316b82805ba6cec766e467774cfa4" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Flooooopy</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Notagull</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Caliiiiiiiiiibre</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span> is an amazing author, she has almost 50 pages on this wiki. She’s really kind and a great person no matter where you talk to her. She's really cool and very good at writing. (Plus she let me steal her code from her author page, so, she's more cooler now.)</p> <p><strong>A Snippet of Normal Conversation With The Flooooop:</strong></p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message one attachone"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="attachment"> <div class="icon-code"></div> <div class="attachmentInner"> <div class="filenameLinkWrapper"><a class="anchor" href="https://i.imgur.com/55UeI7H.mp4" target="_blank">SPOILER_sexy.mp4</a><br /> <div class="metadata">2.71\a0KB</div> </div> </div> <br /> <a class="anchor" href="https://i.imgur.com/55UeI7H.mp4" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:discord-chat-source/download-arrow.svg" alt="download-arrow.svg" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="message two"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Lt Flops</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="content">OMG WTF</div> </div> </div> <div class="message one"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="content">Are you scared yet?</div> </div> </div> <div class="message two"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Lt Flops</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="content">nah</div> </div> </div> <div class="message one"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="content">Aww</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/floppyphoenix">Lt Flops’ Author Page.</a></strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p>Also, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span> is a favorite of mine. He's really cool, and funny, or whatever. He too has almost 50 pages on the wiki, and Notagull and Flooooopy worked on Team Bird together, yet another reason I love these two! If you don’t like his work you are my enemy due to the amount of greatness he exudes. Just go read and updoot his stuff.</p> <p><strong>A Decently Normal Conversation With The Gull:</strong></p> <div class="discord"> <div class="messages-panel"> <div class="messages-group"> <div class="messages"> <div class="message one attachone"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/17/20</div> </div> <div class="attachment"> <div class="icon-code"></div> <div class="attachmentInner"> <div class="filenameLinkWrapper"><a class="anchor" href="https://i.imgur.com/55UeI7H.mp4" target="_blank">SPOILER_sexy.mp4</a><br /> <div class="metadata">2.71\a0KB</div> </div> </div> <br /> <a class="anchor" href="https://i.imgur.com/55UeI7H.mp4" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:discord-chat-source/download-arrow.svg" alt="download-arrow.svg" class="image" /></a></div> </div> </div> <div class="message three"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">not_a_seagull</div> <div class="msg-time">06/19/20</div> </div> <div class="content">I really don’t know what I expected</div> </div> </div> <div class="message one"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/19/20</div> </div> <div class="content">What did you expect..?</div> </div> </div> <div class="message three"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">not_a_seagull</div> <div class="msg-time">06/19/20</div> </div> <div class="content">Idk</div> </div> </div> <div class="message one"> <div class="icon"></div> <div class="body"> <div class="userblock"> <div class="user-name">Karakatt</div> <div class="msg-time">06/19/20</div> </div> <div class="content">XD</div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/not-a-seagull">Not_a_seagull’s Author Page.</a></strong></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p>Also also!! You should go over to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span>’s stuff. He’s really cool and kind, very caring if you’re one of his friends, even if you’re not, he’s just great! Really good at writing too, around 20 pages here on-site, so go take a look and leave an updoot or two! (If you don’t like him, I’ll use my totally <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">non</span> lethal force to delete you.) I absolutely love ALL of his work. He also wrote the code for the SCP listings. (He totally did not bully me into using it…) He is also my boyfriend, so!! (Yes Cal, I know you’re reading this. I love you)</p> <p><strong>A Conversation With The Boldd:</strong></p> <div class="text-container-wrap"> <h3><span>Caliiiiiiibree</span></h3> <div class="text-container"> <div class="sent"> <p><span class="text">Calllllllll</span></p> </div> <div class="recv"> <p><span class="text">What?</span></p> </div> <div class="sent"> <p><span class="text">Bed Wars!</span></p> </div> <div class="recv"> <p><span class="text">Snowball fight</span></p> </div> <div class="sent"> <p><span class="text">But Bed Wars!</span></p> </div> <div class="recv"> <p><span class="text">Fine</span></p> </div> <div class="sent"> <p><span class="text">Tell me when you’re on.</span></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/calibri-bold-s-mega-cool-author-page">Calibri Bold’s Author Page.</a></strong></p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> <hr /> <p>Wait, one more thing!</p> <blockquote> <p>If life happens, and I decide to leave the site, I die, or I otherwise don't exist for 4 years, without anyone knowing about my whereabouts and having the ability to contact me, then I wish for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span> to take ownership of all of my articles (aside from collaborations, which go to their co-authors), and all matters of deletion, porting and licensing are to be forwarded to her. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5045819&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Calibri Bold" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5045819)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" >Calibri Bold</a></span> Has my phone number and he's cool, so if I’m dead or just disappear he’d know.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>The Team Bird Art Page is a special case and should be handled by the Team Bird Team (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009022&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="not_a_seagull" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009022)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1856789&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Ayers" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1856789)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ayers" >Ayers</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2033292&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Quantum Physician" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2033292)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/quantum-physician" >Quantum Physician</a></span>) They’re great people and I have trust in them (Maybe too much.)</p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p>That's it. Go home, you can not stay here!</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7130109&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608108689" alt="Karablue9482" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7130109)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karablue9482" >Karablue9482</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
