&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#C40233&quot;&gt;█&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; The remains of SCP-5866 are to be stored in a transparent container suspended within a standard containment chamber at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/secure-facility-dossier-site-43&quot;&gt;Site-43&lt;/a&gt;, not less than ten metres by ten metres by ten metres in size.&lt;/p&gt;
