&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-224637-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Following the Ursus Maritimus Incident of 2008, the Boring Agreement was created as a binding document which allows Wilson&#039;s Wildlife Solutions to handle the containment of fauna based anomalies within Clackamas County under supervision of the SCP Foundation.&lt;/div&gt;
